WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.549 --> 00:00:05.559
How you doing sir?

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:06.940
I was doing great.

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:09.400
Tell me sir, are you a US citizen?

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:10.700
Am I being detained?

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:12.400
Excuse me?

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:13.840
Are you detaining me?

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:15.780
Are you one of those guys?

00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:18.780
That's great, more citizens should know their
rights.

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:20.140
No sir you are not being detained,

00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:22.400
I would need probable cause for that.

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:25.340
in fact, if you want to get technical, according
to Section 18.7

00:00:25.340 --> 00:00:29.100
of the Border Patrol's Inspector's Field Manual
governing internal checkpoints,

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:31.710
I need have reasonable suspicion that you
are both an alien

00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:34.960
and inside the country illegally before I
can detain you.

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:37.980
And then of course there are the numerous
Constitutional issues at play

00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:39.350
which I'm sure you are aware of.

00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:42.080
Do you have a copy of the pocket Constitution?

00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:43.600
You don't have to answer that.

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:45.380
Here, why don't I just give you one of mine,

00:00:45.380 --> 00:00:50.220
uh here's two actually, that one's in English,
this one's in Arabic if you need that.

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:51.120
Are you recording me?

00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:51.800
Is that on?

00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:53.280
Are you recording me right now?

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:53.920
Oh-

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:55.280
You don't have to answer.

00:00:55.290 --> 00:00:56.829
No, according to the Supreme Court

00:00:56.829 --> 00:00:58.860
Florida v. Royer, Terry v. Ohio.

00:00:58.860 --> 00:01:01.360
You're well within your rights not to respond.

00:01:01.360 --> 00:01:05.560
Truth is I shouldn't even be asking you about
anything not directly regarding your citizenship

00:01:05.560 --> 00:01:07.540
but hey -- I won't tell if you won't ok?

00:01:07.540 --> 00:01:09.320
Well, but you know you got me there, right?

00:01:09.320 --> 00:01:11.320
You got me there, so here, here's what I'm going to do

00:01:11.320 --> 00:01:14.250
I'm going to give you my card, right, it's
got my badge number at the bottom

00:01:14.250 --> 00:01:18.280
and I wrote my direct supervisor's email on
the back there.

00:01:18.280 --> 00:01:21.750
So if you have any questions at all, you just
contact us, okay?

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:24.700
You don't have to answer that either, you
have a good day sir.

00:01:24.700 --> 00:01:28.700
It's cool -- I gave him a pocket Constitution.

00:01:28.700 --> 00:01:30.200
I don't consent to searches!

